{"id":"behauptet","lemma":"behauptet","pos":"adj","rank":1719,"glosses":["asserted, alleged"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/73/De-behauptet.ogg/De-behauptet.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er behauptet, dass es wahr sei.","en":"He maintains that it's true.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"true, real"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Sie behauptet, nichts über ihn zu wissen.","en":"She claims that she knows nothing about him.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to know"}]},{"text":"Jeder, der das behauptet, ist ein Lügner.","en":"Whoever says so is a liar.","words":[{"g":"each"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"liar"}]},{"text":"Er behauptet, ein Maler zu sein.","en":"He claims that he is a painter.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"painter"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Wer behauptet, Tom wusste Bescheid?","en":"Who says Tom knew?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390448","words":[{"g":"who"},null,null,{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"notification"}]}]}